[FINAL-TEXT] The `ospf_snapshot` output reveals the root cause with direct evidence. Comparing the two distribution switches:

| Router | Networks in OSPF config |
|---|---|
| **switch_dist_1_1** | `172.16.0.6/31@0.0.0.1` — **only the uplink; 10.1.1.0/24 is absent** |
